  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MLD: EQUITY INVESTMENT AND LOAN TO THE HOUSING DEVELOPMENT FINANCE CORPORATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a loan of up to $7.5 million to, and an equity investment of up to$4.5 million in the Housing Development Finance Corporation (HDFC) located in the Maldives. HDFC is a specialized finance institution that was established to mobilize long-term financing for the provision of mortgage financing for affordable homes.</narrative>
  </description>
